<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="CH8x3501-en-e9bd8ec2" type="transl"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>Translation of  into (English)</title><editor role="translator">AI - Gemini</editor></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab><availability status="2"><ab>This work has been licensed for use in the TLS</ab></availability></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title/>2026</bibl><ab>Translation of <bibl corresp="#CH8x3501"><title xml:lang="och"/></bibl> into <lang xml:lang="en">English</lang>.</ab></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation resp="#CH">Initially created: <date>2026-04-06T22:06:15.579+09:00</date> by CH</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Translated parts</head><p xml:id="CH8x3501-start"><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.24" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00">,</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.25" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.26" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00">like sections... as inexhaustible as Heaven and Earth,</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.27" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.28" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00">as boundless as rivers and seas.</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.29" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.30" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00">Winter, yet it begins anew;</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.31" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.32" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00">the sun and moon are</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.33" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.34" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00">... changes that do not... change,</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.35" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.36" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00">they cannot be fully comprehended.</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.37" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.38" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00">The unorthodox and the orthodox cyclically generate each other,</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.39" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.40" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00">like a ring without an end,</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.41" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.42" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00">who can exhaust it?</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.43" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.44" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00">The swiftness of water,</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.45" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.46" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00">even when it reaches [a certain point]</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.47" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.48" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00">... can be overcome.</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.49" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.50" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00">Disorder arises from order,</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.51" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.52" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00">coercion arises from incitement,</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.53" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.54" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00">weakness arises from strength.</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.55" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.56" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00">Order and disorder,</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3501_CHANT_002-6a.57" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T22:07:02.714+09:00"/></p></div></body></text></TEI>